<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Nggunakake Variabel lan Simbol Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170654957085">Apa bedane frasa lan ukara? Frasa ngandharake siji gagasan sing durung pepak yen madeg dhewe, dene ukara ngandharake sawijining bab kanthi pepak. Tuladha saka sumber basa Indonesia iki dipadhakake ing basa Jawa: “Mlayu banter banget” yaiku frasa, nanging “Wong sing dolanan bal-balan kuwi mlayu banter banget” yaiku ukara. Ing tuladha iki, ukara nduweni subjek lan predikat. Ing aljabar, ana <emphasis effect="italics">ekspresi</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655102379">
<title>Ekspresi</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654958000"><term id="term-00012">Ekspresi</term> yaiku wilangan, variabel, utawa gabungan wilangan lan variabel sing nggunakake simbol operasi.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654988522"><emphasis effect="bold">Ekspresi</emphasis> mèmper karo frasa ing basa Indonesia. Ing ngisor iki ana sawetara tuladha ekspresi kanthi padanan tetembungane ing basa Jawa:</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655221887" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni telung kolom lan limang larik. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Irah-irahan kolom kapisan yaiku “Ekspresi”, kolom kapindho “Tetembungan”, lan kolom katelu “Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia”. Ing kolom “Ekspresi” ana wujud aljabar: 3, tandha tambah, 5; n, tandha kurang, 1; 6, tandha titik ping-pingan, 7; x ing ndhuwur garis pecahan lan y ing ngisor garis pecahan. Ing kolom “Tetembungan” ana frasa: “3 ditambah lima”, “n dikurangi siji”, “6 ping 7”, lan “x dipara y”. Ing kolom “Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia” ana padanan basa Jawa: “gunggung telu lan lima”, “selisih n lan siji”, “asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu”, lan “asil paran x lan y”.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Tetembungan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">3 ditambah 5</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">gunggung telu lan lima</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> dikurangi siji</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">selisih <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> lan siji</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">6 ping 7</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dipara <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil paran <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655003585">Ing sumber basa Indonesia, frasa-frasa sing padanane dituduhake ing tabel kasebut ora dadi ukara sing pepak amarga ora nduweni predikat.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654938230"><emphasis effect="bold">Persamaan</emphasis> dumadi saka rong ekspresi sing digandhengake dening <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00013">tandha padha karo</term>. Yen simbol-simbol ing persamaan diwaca nganggo tetembungan, ing sumber basa Indonesia kawangun ukara sing pepak. Ing pepadhan iki, tandha padha karo nduweni fungsi minangka predikat. Padanan basa Jawane dituduhake ing ngisor iki.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655118064">
<title>Persamaan</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655170220"><term id="term-00014">Persamaan</term> yaiku rong ekspresi sing digandhengake dening tandha padha karo.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655111405">Ing ngisor iki ana sawetara tuladha persamaan.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655090988" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni rong kolom lan nem larik. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Irah-irahan kolom kapisan yaiku “Persamaan” lan kolom kapindho “Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia”. Ing kolom “Persamaan” ana persamaan: 3, tandha tambah, 5, tandha padha karo, 8; n, tandha kurang, 1, tandha padha karo, 14; 6, tandha titik ping-pingan, 7, tandha padha karo, 42; x, tandha padha karo, 53; y, tandha tambah, 9, tandha padha karo, 2, y, tandha kurang, 3. Ing kolom “Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia” ana padanan basa Jawa: “Gunggung telu lan lima padha karo wolu”, “n dikurangi siji padha karo patbelas”, “Asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu padha karo patang puluh loro”, “x padha karo sèket telu”, lan “y ditambah sanga padha karo loro y dikurangi telu”.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Persamaan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Gunggung telu lan lima padha karo wolu.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> dikurangi siji padha karo patbelas.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu padha karo patang puluh loro.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>53</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> padha karo sèket telu.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah sanga padha karo loro <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> dikurangi telu.</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170654953357"><exercise id="fs-id1170654953360">
<problem id="fs-id1170655229951">
<para id="fs-id1170655162511">Temtokake apa saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu ekspresi utawa persamaan:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655153999"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655111791">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-10" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki mbedakake ekspresi matematika lan persamaan, sarta menehi tuladha lan katrangan kanggo saben jinis.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kalebu <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>—rong ekspresi digandhengake dening tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kalebu <emphasis effect="italics">ekspresi</emphasis>—ora ana tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:math></entry>
   <entry>Iki kalebu <emphasis effect="italics">ekspresi</emphasis>—ora ana tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kalebu <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>—rong ekspresi digandhengake dening tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170655166808" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654924234">
<problem id="fs-id1170654924237">
<para id="fs-id1170655124883">Temtokake apa saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu ekspresi utawa persamaan: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655226888">
<para id="fs-id1170655120617"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> persamaan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> ekspresi</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655205588" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655022136">
<problem id="fs-id1170655027224">
<para id="fs-id1170655027226">Temtokake apa saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu ekspresi utawa persamaan: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>22</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654959582">
<para id="fs-id1170654959584"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> ekspresi <span class="token">ⓑ</span> persamaan</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>
